1
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,460
Hello. Can I help you?

2
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:14,280
Hi. Yes, where can I find toothbrushes?

3
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,220
They’re just there on your right.

4
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:21,940
Oh yes. I didn’t see them. OK, I’ll take this one.

5
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:23,360
Is that all?

6
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,080
No, there’s this toothpaste, too.

7
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,380
OK. So that’s £4.30.

8
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,250
Here you are.

9
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:35,330
And that’s 70p change. Have a nice day.

10
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:36,130
Thank you.

11
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,060
Are you all right there?

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:48,940
Yes, thanks. I just want a cover for my new phone. Have you got this one in red?

13
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,160
Sorry, only black.

14
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:54,280
OK, black’s fine. I’ll take it.

15
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:58,060
Right. That’s twelve ninety-nine please.

16
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,680
Can I pay with my contactless card?

17
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,300
Of course. Just place it over here.

18
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:05,280
OK.

19
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:10,260
Great. That’s gone through. Would you like your receipt?

20
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:11,760
No, it’s OK.

21
00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:19,300
Do you need any help?

22
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:24,060
Hi. These trousers – can I try them on, please?

23
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,740
Sure. What size do you take?

24
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:31,980
Not sure. 28 or 30.

25
00:01:32,540 --> 00:01:36,480
And do you want them in red? We’ve got other colours, too.

26
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:41,160
Yes, I saw them but it’s the red ones I’m interested in.

27
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:47,990
No problem. So why don’t you try both sizes? The changing rooms are in the corner.

28
00:01:48,630 --> 00:01:49,030
Thanks!

29
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,440
Can I help you?

30
00:01:56,840 --> 00:02:01,840
Yeah. These football socks. How much are they? I can’t find the price.

31
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:06,300
Just a moment. They’re eight ninety-nine.

32
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,370
Fine. I’ll take them.

33
00:02:08,670 --> 00:02:11,230
OK, is that cash or card?

34
00:02:11,830 --> 00:02:12,170
Cash.

35
00:02:12,890 --> 00:02:16,700
That’s great and here’s your change and receipt.

36
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:17,600
Thanks.
